        <li>&ldquo;Disputes&rdquo; clause shall mean the Disputes clause of this Order</li>
        <li>&ldquo;Commercial Item&rdquo; means a Commercial Item as defined in FAR 2.101.</li>
        <li>&ldquo;Commercially available off-the-shelf (COTS) item&rdquo; means a COTS item as defined in FAR 2.101</li>
